### Update a Product Template / SKU / Material ###
            
This API allows update product template using JSON PATCH. Few things to note:
- Only replace operations supported
- Except the main ID, all properties listed in the **Create** endpoint can be updated.
- Refer to **Create** endpoint request to see the list of properties.
- The **MetadataFields** is a list of custom fields. It only supports replace the whole list, not update individual item.
    - The _Type_ should be one of the categories: Description, Classifications, ProductAttributes, PackagingAndStorage, OtherGeneral, ProductDates
- Dates need to be in format "yyyy-MM-dd"
            
A sample request will be drafted as:
```
[
    {
        "path": "/Name",
        "op": "replace",
        "value": "New Product Template Name"
    },
    {
        "path": "/OtherGeneral/WarrantyDescription",
        "op": "replace",
        "value": "sample warranty text"
    },
    {
        "value": "2024-01-01",
        "path": "/ProductDates/AvailabilityStartDate",
        "op": "replace"
    },
    {
        "path": "/MetadataFields",
        "op": "replace",
        "value": [
            {
                type: "Description",
                name: "Custom Field 1",
                value: "text value"
            },
            {
                type: "ProductAttributes",
                name: "Custom Field 2",
                NumberValue: 123.50
            },
        ]
            
    }
]
```
